  "subject": "a Wednesday-night church choir rehearsal where the eighty-two-year-old tenor always comes in a beat early, and the conductor quietly starts following him",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien church gospel choir soul in the traditional Black-gospel style. Hammond B3 organ with a slow Leslie swirl and swells; gospel piano with rolling left hand and churchy walk-ups; bass guitar; soft brushed drums; hand claps on two and four in the choruses. Church-hall room sound, the choir spread wide across the stereo field. A warm male lead baritone with a mixed church choir answering in call-and-response. 88 BPM, Ab major. Warm, amused and affectionate. No pop drums, no autotune, no trap, no synth pads, no a cappella-only arrangement.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n拜三暗時 七點半\n教會的詩班 閣咧練歌\n指揮舉手 數一 數二\n阿義伯 就先唱出來\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊八十二歲 唱男高音\n逐家攏笑 無人共伊講\n\n[Chorus]\n早一拍 早一拍\n伊的聲 上大聲\n阮綴伊 嘛無要緊\n歌 照常唱會落去\n\n[Verse]\n指揮 頭起先有共伊講\n後來 共伊的譜畫紅線\n伊共譜 提倒反咧看\n笑笑講 我的目睭較霧\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n這馬 指揮嘛無閣講\n伊舉手 先看阿義伯\n\n[Chorus]\n早一拍 早一拍\n規个詩班 綴伊做伙早\n指揮 偷偷仔改伊的拍\n歌 照常唱會落去\n\n[Bridge]\n有一个拜三 伊去囝兜\n規个詩班 唱甲齊齊齊\n煞感覺 欠一聲\n\n[Chorus]\n早一拍 早一拍\n下禮拜 伊閣來矣\n逐家 攏先看伊的喙\n這擺 阮全部做伙開喙\n\n[Outro]\n阿們 早一拍 嘛阿們",
